  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ST&#xd6;D TILL SWAP SEKRETARIATET MINIRENA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to establishment of SWAP/Secret/MINIRENA - Support to SWAp secreatariat MINIRENA..</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r t&#xe4;nkt att st&#xf6;dja MINIRENA f&#xf6;r att kunna genomf&#xf6;ra EDPRS 2 inf&#xf6;r of&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga som pr&#xe4;glar avdelningen f&#xf6;r planering i minirena.    Projektet fick st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This support was initiated to support MINIRENA to improve the capacity of its Department of Planning in order to be able to oveseer the preparation and implementation of EDPRS 2. The SAWP Secretariat   was provided with financial support of 750,000 SEK for the duration of one year period. The project support has now come to an end and need to prepare completion report.</narrative>
  </description>
